    "gaps": [
      "GL/Metal: master has exact Sonoma pages for the Darwin 23.6 range (kGLDriverPatches_Sonoma) but does not pin them to an exact kern.osversion, so no 14.x PatchData directory is generated for kinds 1/2.",
